<h1>06_政治体制、意识形态与权力治理 (Politics, Ideology & Governance)</h1>
<p style='color:#64748b;margin-bottom:14px;'>本大类共 <b>95</b> 个高阶抽象概念词（分为 <b>4</b> 个折叠子表）• 支持右上角 <b>🇬🇧 英语 / 🇫🇷 法语（含冠词与阴阳性）</b> 一键切换</p>
<div class="sub-nav"><button class='ctrl-btn' onclick='toggleAllSections(true)'>📂 全部展开</button><button class='ctrl-btn secondary' onclick='toggleAllSections(false)'>📁 全部收起</button><span style='color:#a5b4fc;margin:0 4px;'>|</span><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_0')">01_政体制度、主权民主与专制独裁 (22)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_1')">02_意识形态、主义学说与政治运动 (7)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_2')">03_行政权威、外交联盟与地缘博弈 (22)</a><a class='sub-pill' onclick="jumpToSection('sub_3')">04_叛乱、革命、抗议与军事冲突 (44)</a></div>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_0' open><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>01_政体制度、主权民主与专制独裁 (Regimes, Sovereignty, Democracy & Tyranny)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 22 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='20%'>抽象词 (英 / 法切换)</th><th width='13%'>音标 / 发音</th><th width='21%'>中文释义</th><th width='21%'>英文精准定义 (WordNet)</th><th width='5%'>词频</th><th width='20%'>语境例句 & 同义思辨网</th></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>regime</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le gouvernement<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 regime</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/rei'ʒi:m/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/guvɛʁnəmɑ̃/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('regime', 'le gouvernement')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 政权, 当权期间, 政体, 社会制度, 体制, 情态</td><td class='def-en'>the organization that is the governing authority of a political unit</td><td>4.3</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“the government reduced taxes”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>government</span><span class='syn-tag'>authorities</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> polity</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>puppet government<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>le gouvernement fantoche<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 puppet government</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'pʌpit 'gʌvәnmәnt/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/guvɛʁnəmɑ̃ fɑ̃tɔʃ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('puppet government', 'le gouvernement fantoche')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>[法] 傀儡政府</td><td class='def-en'>a government that is appointed by and whose affairs are directed by an outside authority that may impose hardships on those governed</td><td>3.79</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of puppet government (a government that is appointed by and whose affairs are directed by an outside authority that may impose hardships on those governed).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>puppet state</span><span class='syn-tag'>pupet regime</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> government</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>monarchy</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la monarchie<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 monarchy</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'mɒnәki/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/mɔnaʁʃi/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('monarchy', 'la monarchie')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 君主政体, 君主国, 君主政治</td><td class='def-en'>an autocracy governed by a monarch who usually inherits the authority</td><td>3.67</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of monarchy (an autocracy governed by a monarch who usually inherits the authority).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> autocracy</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>federal government<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>le federal government<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 federal government</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'fedәrәl 'gʌvәnmәnt/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/fedeʁal goveʁnmɑ̃/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('federal government', 'le federal government')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>联邦政府；[法] 联邦政府</td><td class='def-en'>a government with strong central powers</td><td>3.64</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of federal government (a government with strong central powers).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> government</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>authoritarian regime<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'authoritarian regime<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 authoritarian regime</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ɒ:.θɒri'tєәriәn rei'ʒi:m/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/otoʁitaʁiɑ̃ ʁeʒim/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('authoritarian regime', 'l\'authoritarian regime')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>威权体制；集权政体</td><td class='def-en'>a government that concentrates political power in an authority not responsible to the people</td><td>3.51</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of authoritarian regime (a government that concentrates political power in an authority not responsible to the people).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>authoritarian state</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> government</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>state government<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>la state government<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 state government</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/steit 'gʌvәnmәnt/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/sta goveʁnmɑ̃/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('state government', 'la state government')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 州政府</td><td class='def-en'>the government of a state in the United States</td><td>3.4</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of state government (the government of a state in the United States).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> government</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>town meeting<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>le town meeting<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 town meeting</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/taun ˈmi:tiŋ/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/town mitiŋ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('town meeting', 'le town meeting')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. <美>镇民大会</td><td class='def-en'>government of a town by an assembly of the qualified voters</td><td>3.36</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of town meeting (government of a town by an assembly of the qualified voters).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> local government</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>political system<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>la régime politique<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 political system</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/pә'litikl 'sistәm/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ʁeʒim pɔlitik/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('political system', 'la régime politique')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>[法] 政治体系, 政治制度</td><td class='def-en'>the members of a social organization who are in power</td><td>3.32</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of political system (the members of a social organization who are in power).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>form of government</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> social group</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>welfare state<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'état-providence<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 welfare state</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'welfєә steit/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/eta pʁɔvidɑ̃s/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('welfare state', 'l\'état-providence')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>福利国家；[经] 福利国家</td><td class='def-en'>a government that undertakes responsibility for the welfare of its citizens through programs in public health and public housing and pensions and unemployment compensation etc.</td><td>3.28</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of welfare state (a government that undertakes responsibility for the welfare of its citizens through programs in public health and public housing and pensions and unemployment compensation etc.).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> state</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>local government<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'administration locale<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 local government</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'lәukәl 'gʌvәnmәnt/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/administʁasjɔ̃ lɔkal/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('local government', 'l\'administration locale')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>地方政府</td><td class='def-en'>the government of a local area</td><td>3.24</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of local government (the government of a local area).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> government</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>totalitarian state<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>le totalitarian state<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 totalitarian state</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/.tәutæli'tєәriәn steit/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/totalitaʁiɑ̃ sta/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('totalitarian state', 'le totalitarian state')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>[法] 极权主义国家</td><td class='def-en'>a government that subordinates the individual to the state and strictly controls all aspects of life by coercive measures</td><td>3.21</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of totalitarian state (a government that subordinates the individual to the state and strictly controls all aspects of life by coercive measures).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>totalitation regime</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> government</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>commission plan<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>la commission plan<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 commission plan</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/kә'miʃәn plæn/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/kɔmisjɔ̃ plɑ̃/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('commission plan', 'la commission plan')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>市委员制(由选出的委员会管理市政的制度)</td><td class='def-en'>a municipal government that combines legislative and executive authority in the members of a commission</td><td>3.2</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of commission plan (a municipal government that combines legislative and executive authority in the members of a commission).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> municipal government</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>military government<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>le military government<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 military government</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ˈmilitəri ˈɡʌvənmənt/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/militaʁy goveʁnmɑ̃/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('military government', 'le military government')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>军事管制政府，军人政府; 军政府</td><td class='def-en'>government by the military and an army</td><td>3.2</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of military government (government by the military and an army).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>stratocracy</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> government</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>municipal government<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>le municipal government<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 municipal government</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/mjuˈnisipəl ˈɡʌvənmənt/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/mynisipal goveʁnmɑ̃/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('municipal government', 'le municipal government')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>市政; 市政府</td><td class='def-en'>the government of a municipality</td><td>3.2</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of municipal government (the government of a municipality).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> local government</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>parliamentary democracy<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>le parliamentary democracy<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 parliamentary democracy</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/.pɑ:lә'mentәri di'mɒkrәsi/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/paʁliamɑ̃taʁy demokʁasy/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('parliamentary democracy', 'le parliamentary democracy')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>议会民主制</td><td class='def-en'>a democracy having a parliament</td><td>3.2</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of parliamentary democracy (a democracy having a parliament).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> democracy</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>police state<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'état policier<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 police state</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/pә'li:s steit/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/eta pɔlisje/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('police state', 'l\'état policier')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>[法] 警察国家</td><td class='def-en'>a country that maintains repressive control over the people by means of police (especially secret police)</td><td>3.2</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of police state (a country that maintains repressive control over the people by means of police (especially secret police)).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> dictatorship</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>puppet state<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>le gouvernement fantoche<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 puppet state</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ˈpʌpit steit/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/guvɛʁnəmɑ̃ fɑ̃tɔʃ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('puppet state', 'le gouvernement fantoche')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 傀儡国</td><td class='def-en'>a government that is appointed by and whose affairs are directed by an outside authority that may impose hardships on those governed</td><td>3.2</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of puppet state (a government that is appointed by and whose affairs are directed by an outside authority that may impose hardships on those governed).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>puppet government</span><span class='syn-tag'>pupet regime</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> government</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>hegemony</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la hégémonie<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 hegemony</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/hi:'dʒemәni/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/eʒemɔni/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('hegemony', 'la hégémonie')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 霸权, 领导权, 支配权, 拥有支配权的政府</td><td class='def-en'>the dominance or leadership of one social group or nation over others</td><td>3.13</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“the hegemony of a single member state is not incompatible with a genuine confederation”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> political system</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>papacy</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le pontificat<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 papacy</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'peipәsi/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/pɔ̃tifika/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('papacy', 'le pontificat')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 罗马教皇职位, 教皇权, 教皇世系</td><td class='def-en'>the government of the Roman Catholic Church</td><td>3.02</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of papacy (the government of the Roman Catholic Church).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>pontificate</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> government</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>oligarchy</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'oligarchie<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 oligarchy</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'ɒligɑ:ki/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ɔligaʁʃi/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('oligarchy', 'l\'oligarchie')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 寡头政治, 寡头政治的政府</td><td class='def-en'>a political system governed by a few people</td><td>2.85</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“one of his cardinal convictions was that Britain was not run as a democracy but as an oligarchy”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> political system</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>autocracy</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'autocratie<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 autocracy</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ɒ:'tɒkrәsi/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/otɔkʁasi/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('autocracy', 'l\'autocratie')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 独裁统治, 独裁统治的国家</td><td class='def-en'>a political system governed by a single individual</td><td>2.62</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of autocracy (a political system governed by a single individual).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>autarchy</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> political system</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>theocracy</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la théocratie<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 theocracy</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/θi'ɒkrәsi/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/teɔkʁasi/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('theocracy', 'la théocratie')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 神权政治, 神权国</td><td class='def-en'>a political unit governed by a deity (or by officials thought to be divinely guided)</td><td>2.59</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of theocracy (a political unit governed by a deity (or by officials thought to be divinely guided)).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> political system</div></div></td></tr>
</table></details>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_1'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>02_意识形态、主义学说与政治运动 (Ideologies, Doctrines & Movements)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 7 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='20%'>抽象词 (英 / 法切换)</th><th width='13%'>音标 / 发音</th><th width='21%'>中文释义</th><th width='21%'>英文精准定义 (WordNet)</th><th width='5%'>词频</th><th width='20%'>语境例句 & 同义思辨网</th></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>capitalism</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le capitalisme<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 capitalism</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'kæpitәlizәm/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/kapitalism/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('capitalism', 'le capitalisme')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 资本主义</td><td class='def-en'>an economic system based on private ownership of capital</td><td>3.97</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of capitalism (an economic system based on private ownership of capital).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>capitalist economy</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> market economy</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>nationalism</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le nationalisme<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 nationalism</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'næʃәnәlizm/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/nasjɔnalism/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('nationalism', 'le nationalisme')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 民族主义, 民族特性</td><td class='def-en'>love of country and willingness to sacrifice for it</td><td>3.83</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“they rode the same wave of popular patriotism”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>patriotism</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> loyalty</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>venture capitalism<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>la venture capitalism<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 venture capitalism</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'ventʃә 'kæpitәlizәm/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/vɑ̃tyʁ kapitalism/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('venture capitalism', 'la venture capitalism')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>venture capital（风险资本）的变形</td><td class='def-en'>capitalism that invests in innovative enterprises (especially high technology) where the potential profits are large</td><td>3.79</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of venture capitalism (capitalism that invests in innovative enterprises (especially high technology) where the potential profits are large).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> capitalism</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>capitalist economy<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>le capitalisme<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 capitalist economy</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ˈkæpɪtlɪst iˈkɔnəmi/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/kapitalism/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('capitalist economy', 'le capitalisme')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>资本主义经济</td><td class='def-en'>an economic system based on private ownership of capital</td><td>3.76</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of capitalist economy (an economic system based on private ownership of capital).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>capitalism</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> market economy</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>patriotism</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le nationalisme<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 patriotism</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'peitriәtizm/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/nasjɔnalism/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('patriotism', 'le nationalisme')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 爱国心, 爱国精神, 爱国主义</td><td class='def-en'>love of country and willingness to sacrifice for it</td><td>3.59</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“they rode the same wave of popular patriotism”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>nationalism</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> loyalty</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>land reform<span class='badge-comp'>复合词</span></span><span class='word-fr-box'>la réforme agraire<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 land reform</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/lænd ri'fɒ:m/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ʁefɔʁm agʁɛʁ/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('land reform', 'la réforme agraire')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>[经] 土地改革</td><td class='def-en'>a redistribution of agricultural land (especially by government action)</td><td>3.36</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of land reform (a redistribution of agricultural land (especially by government action)).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> reform</div></div></td></tr>
<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>chauvinism</span><span class='word-fr-box'>le chauvinisme<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 chauvinism</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'ʃәuvinizm/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ʃovinism/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('chauvinism', 'le chauvinisme')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 盲目的爱国主义, 沙文主义</td><td class='def-en'>fanatical patriotism</td><td>2.49</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of chauvinism (fanatical patriotism).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>jingoism</span><span class='syn-tag'>superpatriotism</span><span class='syn-tag'>ultranationalism</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> patriotism</div></div></td></tr>
</table></details>
<details class='sub-section' id='sub_2'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>03_行政权威、外交联盟与地缘博弈 (Authority, Diplomacy, Treaties & Hegemony)</span><span class='sub-meta'>共 22 词 • 点击展开 / 收起</span></summary><table><tr><th width='20%'>抽象词 (英 / 法切换)</th><th width='13%'>音标 / 发音</th><th width='21%'>中文释义</th><th width='21%'>英文精准定义 (WordNet)</th><th width='5%'>词频</th><th width='20%'>语境例句 & 同义思辨网</th></tr>
